(2191588, 299401, 46046, '<td valign="top">Someone loves the photographer!  That is obvious!  <br/>The negative:  horribly distracting background and give me that right heel.<br/>The positive:  great catchlight in the eyes, wonderful moment, and I actually like the overall framing of the shot if you''d drop it just a smidge (Note: the first time in my life I''ve used the word smidge! :) )</td>', 'Someone loves the photographer!  That is obvious!  The negative:  horribly distracting background and give me that right heel.The positive:  great catchlight in the eyes, wonderful moment, and I actually like the overall framing of the shot if you''d drop it just a smidge (Note: the first time in my life I''ve used the word smidge! :) )', '2006-03-01 01:53:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2191600, 301842, 46046, '<td valign="top">I told my girlfriend that this weeks challenge was "comfort."  She raised her leg and showed me her "house shoes."  So, this must be good,  <br/>The positive:  nice framing and good light (would have like a lbit of a reflector to get the sole of the right slipper.<br/>The negative: wash those things! :)</td>', 'I told my girlfriend that this weeks challenge was "comfort."  She raised her leg and showed me her "house shoes."  So, this must be good,  The positive:  nice framing and good light (would have like a lbit of a reflector to get the sole of the right slipper.The negative: wash those things! :)', '2006-03-01 01:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
