(2191682, 301606, 46046, '<td valign="top">So much potential but there is just too much going on.....no point to draw my eye........If you could position both boys on the same plane and shoot wide open you''d find the shot in my opinion.</td>', 'So much potential but there is just too much going on.....no point to draw my eye........If you could position both boys on the same plane and shoot wide open you''d find the shot in my opinion.', '2006-03-01 02:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
