(2192633, 300911, 35545, '<td valign="top">Does this scene comfort you, or does he look comfortable?<br/> <br/>I like the composition with the diagonal going across the lower left third of the picture.  We don''t see that much.  The splash of red from the sleeping bag and the ribbon on the bear are good, too. <br/> <br/>Thanks for putting some humor in.  (His feet look cold!)</td>', 'Does this scene comfort you, or does he look comfortable? I like the composition with the diagonal going across the lower left third of the picture.  We don''t see that much.  The splash of red from the sleeping bag and the ribbon on the bear are good, too.  Thanks for putting some humor in.  (His feet look cold!)', '2006-03-01 09:25:26.000000', NULL, 1),
