(2192657, 300235, 35545, '<td valign="top">I love the little boy''s profile, but I think all of the white at the bottom distracts.  The drawiing of the car is cute, for purposes of this picture, I would have cropped a lot of it out.</td>', 'I love the little boy''s profile, but I think all of the white at the bottom distracts.  The drawiing of the car is cute, for purposes of this picture, I would have cropped a lot of it out.', '2006-03-01 09:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
