(2192675, 301831, 35545, '<td valign="top">Great smile on the baby, but he needs to be in focus.  Maybe try another angle so his shirt isn''t getting in the way of his face.  <br/> <br/>In a way, I like the movement of his hand.  Babies move.  A lot!</td>', 'Great smile on the baby, but he needs to be in focus.  Maybe try another angle so his shirt isn''t getting in the way of his face.   In a way, I like the movement of his hand.  Babies move.  A lot!', '2006-03-01 09:40:52.000000', NULL, 1);
