(2192810, 300580, 21714, '<td valign="top">Surely a very original and interesting concept. I like it a lot. But I do feel that you could have shot it better. I would preger if the bar had more even lighting and that there was no tilt at all, or if the tilt was greater. Right now, it looks more like you were not able to control it, rather than what you wanted. Anyway, a great idea.</td>', 'Surely a very original and interesting concept. I like it a lot. But I do feel that you could have shot it better. I would preger if the bar had more even lighting and that there was no tilt at all, or if the tilt was greater. Right now, it looks more like you were not able to control it, rather than what you wanted. Anyway, a great idea.', '2006-03-01 10:28:23.000000', NULL, 1),
