(2195231, 299222, 44611, '<td valign="top">Great shot- this really evokes winter and works so well in b &amp; w .... but... I totally fail to see anything comforting, sorry.  Comfort implies warmth, security, nurturing - the complete opposite of winter.  Such a shame, this would have got top marks from me in a winter or ''cold'' challenge.</td>', 'Great shot- this really evokes winter and works so well in b & w .... but... I totally fail to see anything comforting, sorry.  Comfort implies warmth, security, nurturing - the complete opposite of winter.  Such a shame, this would have got top marks from me in a winter or ''cold'' challenge.', '2006-03-02 03:00:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2195237, 301711, 37648, '<td valign="top">Magic photo great focus point. 9</td>', 'Magic photo great focus point. 9', '2006-03-02 03:03:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2195258, 299392, 51533, '<td valign="top">I''m voting this low because I can''t find any connection to the challenge theme and the photo quality seems very poor</td>', 'I''m voting this low because I can''t find any connection to the challenge theme and the photo quality seems very poor', '2006-03-02 03:29:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2195264, 301410, 54314, '<td valign="top">cute dog</td>', 'cute dog', '2006-03-02 03:33:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2195290, 300097, 35720, '<td valign="top">You have captured a nice moment and it meets the challenge well enough IMO, but the light is too harsh for my taste and the background and the shadows are distracting IMO. I also think it would have been better if the man looked at his wife but not at you. Nice shot though.</td>', 'You have captured a nice moment and it meets the challenge well enough IMO, but the light is too harsh for my taste and the background and the shadows are distracting IMO. I also think it would have been better if the man looked at his wife but not at you. Nice shot though.', '2006-03-02 04:05:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2195320, 301731, 49109, '<td valign="top">no midtones, no focus</td>', 'no midtones, no focus', '2006-03-02 05:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
