(2195353, 301380, 52675, '<td valign="top">I wasn''t sure about the light behind baby''s fist, but I think it draws your eye there and that little gesture is what gives the illusion of comfort.  10</td>', 'I wasn''t sure about the light behind baby''s fist, but I think it draws your eye there and that little gesture is what gives the illusion of comfort.  10', '2006-03-02 06:29:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2195355, 300222, 52675, '<td valign="top">Man''s best friend...I can remember being comforted by my dog when I was a child. Great picture!</td>', 'Man''s best friend...I can remember being comforted by my dog when I was a child. Great picture!', '2006-03-02 06:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2195358, 301830, 52675, '<td valign="top">The best of the "Southern Comfort" shots.</td>', 'The best of the "Southern Comfort" shots.', '2006-03-02 06:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2195359, 301447, 52675, '<td valign="top">Nice job.</td>', 'Nice job.', '2006-03-02 06:35:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2195360, 301428, 51533, '<td valign="top">the lighting with flash doesen''t look good at all, I don''t think the fur is a good background although you probably used it for the confort ideea but faied: it doesen''t say confort at all to me, maybe if he had been sleeping it would have been better? the face that is the main and only point of atraction in the image is too dark, I can barely see the eyes; composition is boring and the crop too loose (too much uninteresting pinkish fur around the subject)</td>', 'the lighting with flash doesen''t look good at all, I don''t think the fur is a good background although you probably used it for the confort ideea but faied: it doesen''t say confort at all to me, maybe if he had been sleeping it would have been better? the face that is the main and only point of atraction in the image is too dark, I can barely see the eyes; composition is boring and the crop too loose (too much uninteresting pinkish fur around the subject)', '2006-03-02 06:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2195362, 299026, 51533, '<td valign="top">I voted it 1 because: it doesen''t meet chalenge theme, too small size, poor lighting, color, composition and interest</td>', 'I voted it 1 because: it doesen''t meet chalenge theme, too small size, poor lighting, color, composition and interest', '2006-03-02 06:37:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2195363, 299194, 52675, '<td valign="top">Good idea.  Great picture.</td>', 'Good idea.  Great picture.', '2006-03-02 06:38:23.000000', NULL, 1),
