(2195394, 301024, 38032, '<td valign="top">Gonna give it a shot here ... In my experience DP members don''t enjoy someone reversing the challenge.  Additionally, the photo looks like it was too dark and upon trying to pull something from it the noise came too.  It''s hard to tell exactly what this is - although the old "hand in the waffle iron" just doesn''t appeal - regardless of whether it meets the challenge.</td>', 'Gonna give it a shot here ... In my experience DP members don''t enjoy someone reversing the challenge.  Additionally, the photo looks like it was too dark and upon trying to pull something from it the noise came too.  It''s hard to tell exactly what this is - although the old "hand in the waffle iron" just doesn''t appeal - regardless of whether it meets the challenge.', '2006-03-02 07:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2195395, 300533, 51533, '<td valign="top">cluttered background, especially that bough in foreground; teddy poorly lit (bad exposure)</td>', 'cluttered background, especially that bough in foreground; teddy poorly lit (bad exposure)', '2006-03-02 07:04:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2195396, 301003, 51533, '<td valign="top">just putting "comfort" in the title is not enough; poor light and composition</td>', 'just putting "comfort" in the title is not enough; poor light and composition', '2006-03-02 07:05:31.000000', NULL, 1),
