(2195444, 300787, 53572, '<td valign="top">nice composition, lovely exposure, but that dangly, crotch-pointing piece of grass is distracting.  unless it''s supposed to be?</td>', 'nice composition, lovely exposure, but that dangly, crotch-pointing piece of grass is distracting.  unless it''s supposed to be?', '2006-03-02 07:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
