(2195489, 301643, 22689, '<td valign="top">My sweet Aziz was very similar , your photo brings me back very emotive memories.<br/>I''m glad to see photos of cats even if this opinion is not share by manys , so this is time for a nice "revenge" , I''m going to give an extra point to all cats ! I hope you''ll like the idea.</td>', 'My sweet Aziz was very similar , your photo brings me back very emotive memories.I''m glad to see photos of cats even if this opinion is not share by manys , so this is time for a nice "revenge" , I''m going to give an extra point to all cats ! I hope you''ll like the idea.', '2006-03-02 08:11:48.000000', NULL, 1),
