(2195508, 299661, 22689, '<td valign="top">It''s a cute composition , the idea is good .<br/>It''s not easy to make a selection of a cat because of the fur , you should try to feather the selection next time.</td>', 'It''s a cute composition , the idea is good .It''s not easy to make a selection of a cat because of the fur , you should try to feather the selection next time.', '2006-03-02 08:36:32.000000', NULL, 1),
