(2195647, 301157, 7322, '<td valign="top">Without the title, I''m not really seeing the ''comfort'' aspect of this photo.  I''ts a lovely photo but the snow and water don''t evoke a sense of comfort. There is quite a distance from the viewer to the subject and that also takes a bit away from the idea of comfort to me. This looks like a shoehorn effort to me.</td>', 'Without the title, I''m not really seeing the ''comfort'' aspect of this photo.  I''ts a lovely photo but the snow and water don''t evoke a sense of comfort. There is quite a distance from the viewer to the subject and that also takes a bit away from the idea of comfort to me. This looks like a shoehorn effort to me.', '2006-03-02 10:16:09.000000', NULL, 1),
