(2195703, 301388, 35545, '<td valign="top">Technically, this is a good sharp picture, but there''s too much in it, and it''s starting to look like an ad for a bed and breakfast.  If that''s what you wanted, fine.  You''ve got a lot of interesting stuff in here, I''d like to see you concentrate the interest on one or two objects and maybe just a portion of the tub.</td>', 'Technically, this is a good sharp picture, but there''s too much in it, and it''s starting to look like an ad for a bed and breakfast.  If that''s what you wanted, fine.  You''ve got a lot of interesting stuff in here, I''d like to see you concentrate the interest on one or two objects and maybe just a portion of the tub.', '2006-03-02 10:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
