(2197182, 301551, 42984, '<td valign="top">Beautiful fire, especially the colour and the texture of the flame. Your modle is overlit by the flash and it seems to have spoiled that soft glow that a fire gemerates. That light makes us feel warm and really relate to the pic. <br/> <br/>A way around this is to bounce your flash off the ceiling or if you can set it manually, just let it use a weak ''fill''. I''m guessing that just the fire by itself ddin''t throw enough</td>', 'Beautiful fire, especially the colour and the texture of the flame. Your modle is overlit by the flash and it seems to have spoiled that soft glow that a fire gemerates. That light makes us feel warm and really relate to the pic.  A way around this is to bounce your flash off the ceiling or if you can set it manually, just let it use a weak ''fill''. I''m guessing that just the fire by itself ddin''t throw enough', '2006-03-02 22:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
