(2197360, 300137, 41337, '<td valign="top">Sweet photo. I like the lighting and the composition is good although I''m wondering if a lower angle would have worked better.</td>', 'Sweet photo. I like the lighting and the composition is good although I''m wondering if a lower angle would have worked better.', '2006-03-03 00:14:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2197367, 299751, 41337, '<td valign="top">Nice. I like the composition, contrast and this is really tack sharp. Maybe almost too sharp for a warm and cozy type of shot but still a stellar photo.</td>', 'Nice. I like the composition, contrast and this is really tack sharp. Maybe almost too sharp for a warm and cozy type of shot but still a stellar photo.', '2006-03-03 00:16:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2197375, 299956, 41337, '<td valign="top">This is the best shot of this kind by far.</td>', 'This is the best shot of this kind by far.', '2006-03-03 00:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2197377, 300306, 41337, '<td valign="top">Cute. Seems to lack a little contrast in the sweater/blanket but otherwise nice image. I like the color and overall there is a feeling of warmth.</td>', 'Cute. Seems to lack a little contrast in the sweater/blanket but otherwise nice image. I like the color and overall there is a feeling of warmth.', '2006-03-03 00:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2197380, 301448, 41337, '<td valign="top">Interesting. I like the composition and contrast. I also like how the eyes are looking away and not straight on.</td>', 'Interesting. I like the composition and contrast. I also like how the eyes are looking away and not straight on.', '2006-03-03 00:32:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2197383, 301711, 41337, '<td valign="top">Interesting take to the shot. I like the shallow DOF. The background light is not even but other than that looks good. Oh and what type of tea is that? It looks like coffee to me.</td>', 'Interesting take to the shot. I like the shallow DOF. The background light is not even but other than that looks good. Oh and what type of tea is that? It looks like coffee to me.', '2006-03-03 00:36:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2197387, 301380, 41337, '<td valign="top">Wonderful picture. I love the color and the expressions. I''m not a fan of the smoothed out skin textures but the image in general is very nice.</td>', 'Wonderful picture. I love the color and the expressions. I''m not a fan of the smoothed out skin textures but the image in general is very nice.', '2006-03-03 00:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2197388, 299881, 41337, '<td valign="top">Nice tones. Looks like a very photogenic cat.</td>', 'Nice tones. Looks like a very photogenic cat.', '2006-03-03 00:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2197397, 300939, 41337, '<td valign="top">Good take to the challenge. Technically there are a couple of issues for me. First, the image in general could use a slight curves adjustment to bring out more contrast and color. And second, a fill flash would have really made the bottle pop.</td>', 'Good take to the challenge. Technically there are a couple of issues for me. First, the image in general could use a slight curves adjustment to bring out more contrast and color. And second, a fill flash would have really made the bottle pop.', '2006-03-03 00:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2197407, 301849, 41337, '<td valign="top">Very striking. The only thing I''m not crazy about is the floor texture. I don''t like how you can see the seam in the middle and how it bunches up a bit on the left. On the right side it''s not an issue. Anyway, just my opinion. I score this a 7.</td>', 'Very striking. The only thing I''m not crazy about is the floor texture. I don''t like how you can see the seam in the middle and how it bunches up a bit on the left. On the right side it''s not an issue. Anyway, just my opinion. I score this a 7.', '2006-03-03 00:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2197409, 300002, 41337, '<td valign="top">Wonderful. Feels comforting.</td>', 'Wonderful. Feels comforting.', '2006-03-03 00:52:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2197415, 300183, 41337, '<td valign="top">The shallow DOF really detracts, IMO. I''d suggest either getting everything in focus or at least getting the middle piece more in focus.</td>', 'The shallow DOF really detracts, IMO. I''d suggest either getting everything in focus or at least getting the middle piece more in focus.', '2006-03-03 00:56:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2197419, 301614, 41337, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and the contrast on the couple is great. I wish the color of the water was a bit more pleasing and maybe a tad more contrasty but otherwise great pic.</td>', 'Nice lighting and the contrast on the couple is great. I wish the color of the water was a bit more pleasing and maybe a tad more contrasty but otherwise great pic.', '2006-03-03 01:01:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2197448, 300937, 53668, '<td valign="top">I love donuts and I love this.  So good I can taste it.<br/>Good idea, good focus on the mouth...great close up.</td>', 'I love donuts and I love this.  So good I can taste it.Good idea, good focus on the mouth...great close up.', '2006-03-03 01:13:04.000000', NULL, 1),
