(2197936, 299222, 43437, '<td valign="top">a very well taken picture, nice lighting, good crop use of 3rds rule etc.  May get hammered by the DNMC''s though as this looks cold and forboding rather than comforting.</td>', 'a very well taken picture, nice lighting, good crop use of 3rds rule etc.  May get hammered by the DNMC''s though as this looks cold and forboding rather than comforting.', '2006-03-03 10:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
