(2197939, 299881, 43437, '<td valign="top">very nice subject, i was begining to wonder if I would see any cats actually sleeping, which to me signals more comfort.  Ok, i like the cat, the light glinting off the tousled fur is great.  i dont like the satin part of the blanket or the fabric (couch?) on the left.  They detract from your interesting subject, i was thinking a closer crop but you would have to cut out too much of the cat.</td>', 'very nice subject, i was begining to wonder if I would see any cats actually sleeping, which to me signals more comfort.  Ok, i like the cat, the light glinting off the tousled fur is great.  i dont like the satin part of the blanket or the fabric (couch?) on the left.  They detract from your interesting subject, i was thinking a closer crop but you would have to cut out too much of the cat.', '2006-03-03 11:01:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2197942, 301801, 54028, '<td valign="top">I hope there''s another one in the house.</td>', 'I hope there''s another one in the house.', '2006-03-03 11:02:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2197943, 301266, 35804, '<td valign="top">I really like the light and color, you can almost feel the warmth of the sun...very nice.</td>', 'I really like the light and color, you can almost feel the warmth of the sun...very nice.', '2006-03-03 11:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2197944, 300698, 43437, '<td valign="top">i dont like the blurry thing on the bottom, i do love the reflections of the oreo''s though.</td>', 'i dont like the blurry thing on the bottom, i do love the reflections of the oreo''s though.', '2006-03-03 11:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2197947, 299439, 54028, '<td valign="top">If this was taken two paces sooner and in focus it would have been worth an extra mark</td>', 'If this was taken two paces sooner and in focus it would have been worth an extra mark', '2006-03-03 11:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2197948, 300937, 35804, '<td valign="top">Great textures!</td>', 'Great textures!', '2006-03-03 11:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
