(2197962, 299029, 35804, '<td valign="top">A really interesting composition and perspective...I like the shallow focus, the colors and the textures which are really the star of this image...the snow, the wool rough and smooth...very nice.</td>', 'A really interesting composition and perspective...I like the shallow focus, the colors and the textures which are really the star of this image...the snow, the wool rough and smooth...very nice.', '2006-03-03 11:24:21.000000', NULL, 1),
