(2198441, 301448, 5728, '<td valign="top">Impressive image, although I find the bear too dominant and the little (cute) girl a kind of secondary. But that said I am not sure what I would have done differently to change it, so it''s good as it is. Good work.</td>', 'Impressive image, although I find the bear too dominant and the little (cute) girl a kind of secondary. But that said I am not sure what I would have done differently to change it, so it''s good as it is. Good work.', '2006-03-03 16:34:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2198444, 301711, 53964, '<td valign="top">Like the simplicity of the cup with the rich look of the chocolate, but the blur is a little heavy for my liking. Too tight? maybe not quite centered right? I''m not sure, but it just doesn''t QUITE work for me.</td>', 'Like the simplicity of the cup with the rich look of the chocolate, but the blur is a little heavy for my liking. Too tight? maybe not quite centered right? I''m not sure, but it just doesn''t QUITE work for me.', '2006-03-03 16:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
