(2198586, 301397, 53964, '<td valign="top">Tight bottom crop and shadow and shiny shape on bottom are distracting. Could be a bit sharper. I like the idea, tho.</td>', 'Tight bottom crop and shadow and shiny shape on bottom are distracting. Could be a bit sharper. I like the idea, tho.', '2006-03-03 17:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
