(2199727, 301587, 35034, '<td valign="top">What a great picture!  It works both technically and as a gritty yet appropriate challenge entrant.  Kudos!</td>', 'What a great picture!  It works both technically and as a gritty yet appropriate challenge entrant.  Kudos!', '2006-03-04 10:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2199728, 301801, 35034, '<td valign="top">One of the best in the challenge.  I like everything aobut this picture from the technical ( wonderful tone on tone and composition) to the feeling it evokes of being comfortable and protected on a yucky day.  A 10.</td>', 'One of the best in the challenge.  I like everything aobut this picture from the technical ( wonderful tone on tone and composition) to the feeling it evokes of being comfortable and protected on a yucky day.  A 10.', '2006-03-04 10:27:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2199729, 301632, 35034, '<td valign="top">I wish the cat were a tad better focused.  In spite of that, I have to give you a 10, because I can just feel the stretch...  What a great depiction of comfort!</td>', 'I wish the cat were a tad better focused.  In spite of that, I have to give you a 10, because I can just feel the stretch...  What a great depiction of comfort!', '2006-03-04 10:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2199730, 301146, 51457, '<td valign="top">me too!</td>', 'me too!', '2006-03-04 10:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2199731, 299513, 35034, '<td valign="top">Snug indeed!  Lovely picture.</td>', 'Snug indeed!  Lovely picture.', '2006-03-04 10:28:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2199732, 300222, 35034, '<td valign="top">Sweet!  I can almost smell that baby-puppy smell!</td>', 'Sweet!  I can almost smell that baby-puppy smell!', '2006-03-04 10:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2199733, 301873, 35034, '<td valign="top">Perfect!  I don''t know why she makes me feel comfort, but she does.  I suspect it''s a combination of her sweet smile and the well-edited image.  The grainy effect is particularly pleasing here.</td>', 'Perfect!  I don''t know why she makes me feel comfort, but she does.  I suspect it''s a combination of her sweet smile and the well-edited image.  The grainy effect is particularly pleasing here.', '2006-03-04 10:29:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2199734, 301209, 35034, '<td valign="top">Great color and composition.  You also did a wonderful job of conveying comfort thuough a subtle, indirect means.  Congratualations on a great shot.</td>', 'Great color and composition.  You also did a wonderful job of conveying comfort thuough a subtle, indirect means.  Congratualations on a great shot.', '2006-03-04 10:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2199735, 301733, 35034, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot.  Keeping the surroundings in focus really adds to the feeling of comfort and being at home.</td>', 'Wonderful shot.  Keeping the surroundings in focus really adds to the feeling of comfort and being at home.', '2006-03-04 10:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2199736, 299539, 35034, '<td valign="top">This is a gorgeous photo.  The color, texture, and framing are just perfect.  I gave it a 7 because it was so lovely, even though it didn''t really evoke anything to do woit comfort.  What a sweet face!</td>', 'This is a gorgeous photo.  The color, texture, and framing are just perfect.  I gave it a 7 because it was so lovely, even though it didn''t really evoke anything to do woit comfort.  What a sweet face!', '2006-03-04 10:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2199738, 301207, 35034, '<td valign="top">She''s probably going to hate you in a few years, but this is just lovely!  Glad you were able to catch her in such sweet sleep.  Nice angle, and well lit.  The control of depth of field focouses on her face, and keeps the photo as a whole from being too busy.  Good shot!</td>', 'She''s probably going to hate you in a few years, but this is just lovely!  Glad you were able to catch her in such sweet sleep.  Nice angle, and well lit.  The control of depth of field focouses on her face, and keeps the photo as a whole from being too busy.  Good shot!', '2006-03-04 10:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2199739, 301242, 35034, '<td valign="top">Lovely picture, and one of the only successful landsacpe-as-comfort pictures that really work.  Lighthouses are such powerful images...  Wonderful idea, and what good fortune to be near enough such a lovely spot to b able to shoot it at will!</td>', 'Lovely picture, and one of the only successful landsacpe-as-comfort pictures that really work.  Lighthouses are such powerful images...  Wonderful idea, and what good fortune to be near enough such a lovely spot to b able to shoot it at will!', '2006-03-04 10:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
