(2200425, 300698, 36382, '<td valign="top">The big white square at the bottom of the picture is really distracting.  Only five on this one I am afraid, but keep trying.  Thanks for your PM.  How to improve?  Well that would depend on what you were trying to achieve with your picture.  I did not realise that it was shot through the bottom of a glass and I didn''t realise that the white square was milk.  Maybe if you zoomed out from the glass it would be more obvious what it was and then you could have some cookies shot through the glass and distorted by it and some cookies nice and sharp which haven''t been distorted by the glass.  At the moment everything seems unsharp because of the glass and my eye has a hard time resting on anything.  Hope this helps.  Good luck!</td>', 'The big white square at the bottom of the picture is really distracting.  Only five on this one I am afraid, but keep trying.  Thanks for your PM.  How to improve?  Well that would depend on what you were trying to achieve with your picture.  I did not realise that it was shot through the bottom of a glass and I didn''t realise that the white square was milk.  Maybe if you zoomed out from the glass it would be more obvious what it was and then you could have some cookies shot through the glass and distorted by it and some cookies nice and sharp which haven''t been distorted by the glass.  At the moment everything seems unsharp because of the glass and my eye has a hard time resting on anything.  Hope this helps.  Good luck!', '2006-03-04 18:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
