(2200939, 300936, 54490, '<td valign="top">There is no greater comfort for me than to look up in the sky and see what I call God clouds. :)</td>', 'There is no greater comfort for me than to look up in the sky and see what I call God clouds. :)', '2006-03-05 01:03:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2200940, 300942, 41574, '<td valign="top">A somewhat disconnected photograph of an otherwise comfort-bringing object. A warmer environment might have been nice.</td>', 'A somewhat disconnected photograph of an otherwise comfort-bringing object. A warmer environment might have been nice.', '2006-03-05 01:07:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2200942, 300377, 41574, '<td valign="top">Where''s the "comfort"? I don''t even see a "homely nest."</td>', 'Where''s the "comfort"? I don''t even see a "homely nest."', '2006-03-05 01:07:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2200943, 301078, 41574, '<td valign="top">The color is unappealing to me, but the composition and subject matter are commendable. I hated it in the thumbnail, but, at full size (posted size), it''s not bad.</td>', 'The color is unappealing to me, but the composition and subject matter are commendable. I hated it in the thumbnail, but, at full size (posted size), it''s not bad.', '2006-03-05 01:08:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2200944, 301874, 41574, '<td valign="top">Your comfort is alcohol? Nice.</td>', 'Your comfort is alcohol? Nice.', '2006-03-05 01:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2200950, 299611, 41574, '<td valign="top">Comfort?</td>', 'Comfort?', '2006-03-05 01:10:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2200951, 299029, 41574, '<td valign="top">Too obscure an angle for my taste.</td>', 'Too obscure an angle for my taste.', '2006-03-05 01:11:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2200952, 301463, 41574, '<td valign="top">Too small a shot, and not very "comforting."</td>', 'Too small a shot, and not very "comforting."', '2006-03-05 01:11:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2200953, 301870, 41574, '<td valign="top">Altogether now: Aawww...</td>', 'Altogether now: Aawww...', '2006-03-05 01:11:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2200954, 299330, 41574, '<td valign="top">A simple, unimaginative snapshot. It looks as though you were out, you saw a bird, and you quickly hit the shutter-release on your camera.</td>', 'A simple, unimaginative snapshot. It looks as though you were out, you saw a bird, and you quickly hit the shutter-release on your camera.', '2006-03-05 01:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2200956, 301130, 41574, '<td valign="top">Mildly creative; technically, superb...perfect.</td>', 'Mildly creative; technically, superb...perfect.', '2006-03-05 01:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2200957, 301146, 41574, '<td valign="top">I''m getting a little sick of all the shots of alcohol in the "comfort" challenge.</td>', 'I''m getting a little sick of all the shots of alcohol in the "comfort" challenge.', '2006-03-05 01:13:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2200958, 300911, 41574, '<td valign="top">Hehe.</td>', 'Hehe.', '2006-03-05 01:13:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2200959, 301518, 54490, '<td valign="top">As much as I love a good pair of old, worn shoes, I don''t find the insoles very appealing.</td>', 'As much as I love a good pair of old, worn shoes, I don''t find the insoles very appealing.', '2006-03-05 01:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2200960, 300316, 41574, '<td valign="top">Is it just me, or is nothing in this shot in focus? Also, there seems to be a lot of alcohol and tobacco in the "comfort" challenge? Is this because these things are truly comforting, or because they seem like the obligatory "risque entries"?</td>', 'Is it just me, or is nothing in this shot in focus? Also, there seems to be a lot of alcohol and tobacco in the "comfort" challenge? Is this because these things are truly comforting, or because they seem like the obligatory "risque entries"?', '2006-03-05 01:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2200961, 299668, 41574, '<td valign="top">One of the best entries I''ve seen thus far.</td>', 'One of the best entries I''ve seen thus far.', '2006-03-05 01:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2200962, 301529, 41574, '<td valign="top">Yay: another bottle of alcohol for "comfort." This one really just looks like an ad. for a magazine.</td>', 'Yay: another bottle of alcohol for "comfort." This one really just looks like an ad. for a magazine.', '2006-03-05 01:15:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2200963, 301195, 41574, '<td valign="top">I love the angle, and I love the shot. It''s got that "comfortable in your house [maybe hotel]" "feel."</td>', 'I love the angle, and I love the shot. It''s got that "comfortable in your house [maybe hotel]" "feel."', '2006-03-05 01:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2200965, 301872, 54490, '<td valign="top">She looks frightened.</td>', 'She looks frightened.', '2006-03-05 01:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2200966, 301676, 41574, '<td valign="top">He doesn''t look comfortable, and his apparent discomfort seems to make me uncomfortable. It''s a nice portrait shot, but I don''t feel that it fits this challenge. (If [ascertained solely from your title] you were going for the "his friendship comforts me" thing, then it''s too much of a stretch to work.)</td>', 'He doesn''t look comfortable, and his apparent discomfort seems to make me uncomfortable. It''s a nice portrait shot, but I don''t feel that it fits this challenge. (If [ascertained solely from your title] you were going for the "his friendship comforts me" thing, then it''s too much of a stretch to work.)', '2006-03-05 01:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2200970, 301447, 41574, '<td valign="top">I love the guy''s expression (it looks very genuine), and...well, I just really like the shot. Good work.</td>', 'I love the guy''s expression (it looks very genuine), and...well, I just really like the shot. Good work.', '2006-03-05 01:18:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2200971, 301421, 41574, '<td valign="top">A mediocre picture of a cup of coffee. Sorry, but it doesn''t do anything for me.</td>', 'A mediocre picture of a cup of coffee. Sorry, but it doesn''t do anything for me.', '2006-03-05 01:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2200972, 301632, 41574, '<td valign="top">Could have been a really nice shot, but the composition and poor focus ruin much of its charm.</td>', 'Could have been a really nice shot, but the composition and poor focus ruin much of its charm.', '2006-03-05 01:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2200973, 301832, 41574, '<td valign="top">Sitting around in fancy clothes is hardly "comfort." I pair of jeans and a t-shirt, and this technically-sound shot could have really fit this challenge.</td>', 'Sitting around in fancy clothes is hardly "comfort." I pair of jeans and a t-shirt, and this technically-sound shot could have really fit this challenge.', '2006-03-05 01:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2200974, 301788, 41574, '<td valign="top">I don''t know, it feels like to much of a "forced portrait shot" to be anything else. It doesn''t represent comfort, per se, and the fact that it''s not a "real moment" takes away from any sense that it might simply be something that brings you comfort.</td>', 'I don''t know, it feels like to much of a "forced portrait shot" to be anything else. It doesn''t represent comfort, per se, and the fact that it''s not a "real moment" takes away from any sense that it might simply be something that brings you comfort.', '2006-03-05 01:20:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2200975, 301426, 41574, '<td valign="top">What the hell? Ummm...no comment.</td>', 'What the hell? Ummm...no comment.', '2006-03-05 01:21:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2200977, 301597, 41574, '<td valign="top">Technically brilliant, but I don''t "love it"; I can''t seem to express exactly why, but it might be somewhat because the shot, ironically, feels a bit too "artificial."</td>', 'Technically brilliant, but I don''t "love it"; I can''t seem to express exactly why, but it might be somewhat because the shot, ironically, feels a bit too "artificial."', '2006-03-05 01:22:14.000000', NULL, 1),
