(2200979, 301212, 41574, '<td valign="top">I''m sure that this might have meaning to you, and it''s a great subject for this challenge, but, technically, the shot is little but a typcial "snapshot."</td>', 'I''m sure that this might have meaning to you, and it''s a great subject for this challenge, but, technically, the shot is little but a typcial "snapshot."', '2006-03-05 01:23:45.000000', NULL, 1),
