(2202145, 301789, 53808, '<td valign="top">Well I couldn''t agree with you more - this is certainly my idea of comfort... Candle reflection is superb.</td>', 'Well I couldn''t agree with you more - this is certainly my idea of comfort... Candle reflection is superb.', '2006-03-05 19:23:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2202159, 301447, 53808, '<td valign="top">This is lovely - a genuinely happy picture, and the right title too. The wooded background works really well.</td>', 'This is lovely - a genuinely happy picture, and the right title too. The wooded background works really well.', '2006-03-05 19:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2202176, 301447, 54527, '<td valign="top">I just love this shot.  There''s nothing like an animal to give comfort.  I also love the b&amp;w medium, so this one really caught my attention.  Clear, crip... I love it!</td>', 'I just love this shot.  There''s nothing like an animal to give comfort.  I also love the b&w medium, so this one really caught my attention.  Clear, crip... I love it!', '2006-03-05 19:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2202204, 301788, 53806, '<td valign="top">your subject reminds me of my grandmothers'' smiles, and indeed there is something about all of them that comforts us. very personal shot, i like it. from a technical standpoint, overall good. The lighting is nice and subtle, yet i wish her left side weren''t so dark...</td>', 'your subject reminds me of my grandmothers'' smiles, and indeed there is something about all of them that comforts us. very personal shot, i like it. from a technical standpoint, overall good. The lighting is nice and subtle, yet i wish her left side weren''t so dark...', '2006-03-05 20:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2202210, 301725, 53806, '<td valign="top">very cute shot with your choice of colors and lighting. and anyone''s favorite song is indeed comforting!</td>', 'very cute shot with your choice of colors and lighting. and anyone''s favorite song is indeed comforting!', '2006-03-05 20:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2202215, 301209, 53806, '<td valign="top">i like the idea you express here. i think everyone has a favorite lived-in pair of something they can relate to! techical-wise: i like the lighitng b/c it makes me envision it as if it was hanging in a closet by a window. well done here :)</td>', 'i like the idea you express here. i think everyone has a favorite lived-in pair of something they can relate to! techical-wise: i like the lighitng b/c it makes me envision it as if it was hanging in a closet by a window. well done here :)', '2006-03-05 20:18:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2202218, 301654, 53806, '<td valign="top">from a technical standpoint this is very well done. i only wish that all the letters on the bottle could have reflected the light...</td>', 'from a technical standpoint this is very well done. i only wish that all the letters on the bottle could have reflected the light...', '2006-03-05 20:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2202221, 301529, 53806, '<td valign="top">you did a very nice job with this shot! almost looks like it''s from a commercial...</td>', 'you did a very nice job with this shot! almost looks like it''s from a commercial...', '2006-03-05 20:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2202227, 301671, 53806, '<td valign="top">very good subject manner! i only wish that flattering subtle lighting on the baby''s face could have been on the arm and body as well...but overall, very nice :)</td>', 'very good subject manner! i only wish that flattering subtle lighting on the baby''s face could have been on the arm and body as well...but overall, very nice :)', '2006-03-05 20:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2202233, 301798, 53806, '<td valign="top">even though this shot only consists of words on paper, it''s moving. to me it has that double-meaning of both the actual scripture being comforting and having the entire Bible itself as a source of comfort as well. and good job with sharpening the "comfort" line and blurring out the other scriptures, but just enough where you can read them too :)</td>', 'even though this shot only consists of words on paper, it''s moving. to me it has that double-meaning of both the actual scripture being comforting and having the entire Bible itself as a source of comfort as well. and good job with sharpening the "comfort" line and blurring out the other scriptures, but just enough where you can read them too :)', '2006-03-05 20:26:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2202240, 301618, 53806, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot, just stunning...</td>', 'beautiful shot, just stunning...', '2006-03-05 20:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2202243, 301646, 53806, '<td valign="top">i really like how you incorporated an actual person in the shot. and the picture overall is indeed very nice :)</td>', 'i really like how you incorporated an actual person in the shot. and the picture overall is indeed very nice :)', '2006-03-05 20:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2202253, 301217, 53806, '<td valign="top">very cute! converting to black and white will be very flattering, try it!...and maybe cropping the few words on the left boy''s shirt :)</td>', 'very cute! converting to black and white will be very flattering, try it!...and maybe cropping the few words on the left boy''s shirt :)', '2006-03-05 20:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
