(2204389, 301568, 54583, '<td valign="top">I think this subject is very comfortable.  I just can´t work out who this person is, a mum who just got the kids to bed, or a granny, knitting for those kids.   A half drunken cup of tea whould suggest that the person is coming back again, and the inclusion op a personal item may help to identify  the knitter.</td>', 'I think this subject is very comfortable.  I just can´t work out who this person is, a mum who just got the kids to bed, or a granny, knitting for those kids.   A half drunken cup of tea whould suggest that the person is coming back again, and the inclusion op a personal item may help to identify  the knitter.', '2006-03-06 13:01:54.000000', NULL, 1),
