(2205241, 301801, 29490, '<td valign="top">Initial response: positive<br/> <br/>I like this photo, simple, effective, interesting.  It lacks something and I just can''t see what that something may be ... I''m going with 8 to start.  Yes, 8 - final answer for now.  I''ll have to visit later.</td>', 'Initial response: positive I like this photo, simple, effective, interesting.  It lacks something and I just can''t see what that something may be ... I''m going with 8 to start.  Yes, 8 - final answer for now.  I''ll have to visit later.', '2006-03-06 18:08:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2205248, 300547, 51802, '<td valign="top">It is a bit over exposed.  The rectangle really steals attention from the cross.</td>', 'It is a bit over exposed.  The rectangle really steals attention from the cross.', '2006-03-06 18:11:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2205264, 300125, 29490, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, very nicely photographed.</td>', 'I like the composition, very nicely photographed.', '2006-03-06 18:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2205268, 300406, 42005, '<td valign="top">So many photographs in this cfhallenge are a real stretch for the topic.  I keep coming back to this and every time I like it better.  The focus is great; it is sharp and has the touch of color necessary to keep<br/>my interest. But most of all, I can almost smell it and it never fails to make me want something salty.<br/>So, you get a ten and a thank you for sharing!</td>', 'So many photographs in this cfhallenge are a real stretch for the topic.  I keep coming back to this and every time I like it better.  The focus is great; it is sharp and has the touch of color necessary to keepmy interest. But most of all, I can almost smell it and it never fails to make me want something salty.So, you get a ten and a thank you for sharing!', '2006-03-06 18:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2205278, 301730, 42005, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of black and red.</td>', 'Interesting use of black and red.', '2006-03-06 18:15:53.000000', NULL, 1),
