(2205289, 300097, 42005, '<td valign="top">The comfort of getting one''s husband home from a desert area is so shown on Kelley''s face.<br/>And the smile he gives to the camera saying, "Yeah, I made it and I am glad to share it with<br/>all of you for whom I served" is inexcapable.  Great candid shot full of happiness and emotion.<br/>Yeah USA!  Thank you Major Murphy.</td>', 'The comfort of getting one''s husband home from a desert area is so shown on Kelley''s face.And the smile he gives to the camera saying, "Yeah, I made it and I am glad to share it withall of you for whom I served" is inexcapable.  Great candid shot full of happiness and emotion.Yeah USA!  Thank you Major Murphy.', '2006-03-06 18:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
