(2205444, 301654, 53964, '<td valign="top">I like it. The bottle has kind of a strongman, shoulders squared-against-the-world and chest-stuck-out feel to me. I can almost picture the superhero cape! The trace of light diffusing off the ice against the black just accentuates the cold as does the fact that the ice isn''t crystal clear.</td>', 'I like it. The bottle has kind of a strongman, shoulders squared-against-the-world and chest-stuck-out feel to me. I can almost picture the superhero cape! The trace of light diffusing off the ice against the black just accentuates the cold as does the fact that the ice isn''t crystal clear.', '2006-03-06 19:01:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2205453, 301597, 53964, '<td valign="top">For the most part I really like this. The lilies stand out so sharply and the colour is lovely. I think the hard glass angle contrasts well with the organics. However, I feel the crop is a bit tight on top, and the bits of flower in lower left and right clutter. I''m not sure how I feel about the crystal on the stand.</td>', 'For the most part I really like this. The lilies stand out so sharply and the colour is lovely. I think the hard glass angle contrasts well with the organics. However, I feel the crop is a bit tight on top, and the bits of flower in lower left and right clutter. I''m not sure how I feel about the crystal on the stand.', '2006-03-06 19:05:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2205632, 299751, 47852, '<td valign="top">Love this shot.. one of my top picks!  The little hairs are a bit distracting, and there''s a small overexposed spot at the top... but its such an adorable shot, that those things are easily overlookable (is that a word?).  You captured some great textures in the sweater and the cat''s fur, yet her face is very soft in comparison.  And really, the entire key to this shot for me is the complete relaxation and contentment in both of their expressions.  If I tried this with my cat, she''d be squirming and squiggling to get away.  A fantastic job!</td>', 'Love this shot.. one of my top picks!  The little hairs are a bit distracting, and there''s a small overexposed spot at the top... but its such an adorable shot, that those things are easily overlookable (is that a word?).  You captured some great textures in the sweater and the cat''s fur, yet her face is very soft in comparison.  And really, the entire key to this shot for me is the complete relaxation and contentment in both of their expressions.  If I tried this with my cat, she''d be squirming and squiggling to get away.  A fantastic job!', '2006-03-06 19:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
