(2209794, 301801, 7322, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by emmylou:</b></div><hr/><i> Doh!  This should be in the top ten!<br/> <br/>Well... its in MY top ten! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks a bunch. I''m actually pleased it did as well as it did considering it has so much that the average DPC voter seems to hate (centered subject, blown-out light, b&amp;W). I thought it was funny for the challenge but I also like the image on it''s own merit.</td>', 'Originally posted by emmylou: Doh!  This should be in the top ten! Well... its in MY top ten!   Thanks a bunch. I''m actually pleased it did as well as it did considering it has so much that the average DPC voter seems to hate (centered subject, blown-out light, b&W). I thought it was funny for the challenge but I also like the image on it''s own merit.', '2006-03-08 02:11:25.000000', NULL, 0),
