(2209911, 299681, 53964, '<td valign="top">Thanks to all who took time to look and vote. I''m very happy with my results on my first challenge. I was disappointed by the lack of comments because I really want to learn, but I realise I DID learn.<br/>I concentrated on the technical aspects and they must have been okay, but the picture was just "nice". It had absolutely no WOW factor. But one step at a time!  I always think up ideas but don''t know how to bring them to reality and that''s what I''m learning here. I can''t believe how much I''ve absorbed just in a couple weeks!.</td>', 'Thanks to all who took time to look and vote. I''m very happy with my results on my first challenge. I was disappointed by the lack of comments because I really want to learn, but I realise I DID learn.I concentrated on the technical aspects and they must have been okay, but the picture was just "nice". It had absolutely no WOW factor. But one step at a time!  I always think up ideas but don''t know how to bring them to reality and that''s what I''m learning here. I can''t believe how much I''ve absorbed just in a couple weeks!.', '2006-03-08 03:14:37.000000', NULL, 0),
