(2238062, 299401, 43437, '<td valign="top">I love this picture.  Its a bit soft and I guess to some the background might be a bit distracting, if this had been advanced you could have darkened it some more.  great lighting and a perfect expression.  You might have wanted to shift the camera to the right some so she is on the left side of the frame, just because that is the way she is facing, kind of leads us out of the picture.  Oh yes, and we must have the feet.  I think this fits the challenge perfectly and poo on anyone who says otherwise :)</td>', 'I love this picture.  Its a bit soft and I guess to some the background might be a bit distracting, if this had been advanced you could have darkened it some more.  great lighting and a perfect expression.  You might have wanted to shift the camera to the right some so she is on the left side of the frame, just because that is the way she is facing, kind of leads us out of the picture.  Oh yes, and we must have the feet.  I think this fits the challenge perfectly and poo on anyone who says otherwise :)', '2006-03-18 20:46:46.000000', NULL, 0),
